---
// V2 — "Raster": Zweispaltiges Raster. Schlanke Etikettspalte links, Inhalt rechts.
// Referenz: Architekturbüros, Schweizer Gestaltung, 2x4, SO–IL, David Chipperfield.
---
<!doctype html>
<html lang="de">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1" />
  <title>Henrik Asmus — V2</title>
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="/styles/global.css" />
  <style>
    .v2 {
      max-width: 700px;
      margin: 0 auto;
      padding: 56px 24px 140px;
      font-family: 'Geist', Inter, system-ui, sans-serif;
    }

    /* Header */
    .v2-head {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: space-between;
      margin-bottom: 80px;
    }
    .v2-lang {
      font-size: 12px;
      letter-spacing: 0.04em;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
    }
    .v2-lang a { color: #A9B0B5; text-decoration: none; }
    .v2-lang a.on { color: #121517; }
    .v2-lang a:hover { color: #121517; }
    .v2-lang-slash { color: #DFE3E6; margin: 0 6px; }

    /* Name block — volle Breite */
    .v2-intro {
      margin-bottom: 72px;
    }
    .v2-name {
      font-size: 38px;
      font-weight: 500;
      letter-spacing: -0.032em;
      line-height: 1.05;
      color: #121517;
      margin-bottom: 12px;
    }
    .v2-sub {
      font-size: 14px;
      font-weight: 400;
      letter-spacing: -0.005em;
      line-height: 1.55;
      color: #8A9197;
    }

    /* Grid ab hier */
    .v2-row {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: 88px 1fr;
      gap: 0 32px;
      margin-bottom: 64px;
    }
    .v2-row:last-child { margin-bottom: 0; }

    .v2-label-col {
      padding-top: 3px;
    }
    .v2-label {
      font-size: 11px;
      font-weight: 400;
      letter-spacing: 0.07em;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      color: #C2C8CC;
      line-height: 1;
    }

    /* Work */
    .v2-t1 {
      display: block;
      font-size: 19px;
      font-weight: 500;
      letter-spacing: -0.028em;
      line-height: 1.25;
      color: #121517;
    }
    .v2-t2 {
      display: block;
      font-size: 19px;
      font-weight: 500;
      letter-spacing: -0.028em;
      line-height: 1.25;
      background: linear-gradient(100deg, #78828A 0%, #C3CACF 50%, #78828A 100%);
      -webkit-background-clip: text;
      background-clip: text;
      color: transparent;
    }
    .v2-meta {
      margin-top: 12px;
      font-size: 12px;
      font-weight: 400;
      letter-spacing: 0.01em;
      color: #AAB1B6;
    }
    .v2-body {
      margin-top: 18px;
      font-size: 14px;
      font-weight: 400;
      letter-spacing: -0.005em;
      line-height: 1.72;
      color: #61686E;
    }
    .v2-links {
      margin-top: 20px;
      display: flex;
      gap: 0 24px;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
    }
    .v2-links a {
      font-size: 13px;
      font-weight: 400;
      letter-spacing: -0.004em;
      color: #121517;
      text-decoration: none;
    }
    .v2-links a:hover { text-decoration: underline; text-underline-offset: 3px; }
    .v2-links a.dim { color: #9BA2A8; }

    /* Contact */
    .v2-email {
      font-size: 14px;
      font-weight: 400;
      letter-spacing: -0.006em;
      color: #121517;
      text-decoration: none;
    }
    .v2-email:hover { text-decoration: underline; text-underline-offset: 3px; }

    @media (max-width: 639px) {
      .v2-row {
        grid-template-columns: 1fr;
        gap: 0;
      }
      .v2-label-col {
        margin-bottom: 16px;
      }
      .v2-name { font-size: 30px; }
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
<div class="v2">
  <div class="v2-head">
    <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 20 20" width="18" height="18" fill="none" aria-hidden="true">
      <defs>
        <linearGradient id="sg2" x1="0" y1="0" x2="1" y2="1">
          <stop offset="0%" stop-color="#D6DCE0"/>
          <stop offset="45%" stop-color="#6E777E"/>
          <stop offset="100%" stop-color="#AAB2B8"/>
        </linearGradient>
      </defs>
      <path d="M10 3 L16.5 14 H3.5 Z" stroke="url(#sg2)" stroke-width="1.4" stroke-linejoin="round" fill="none"/>
      <line x1="2" y1="17" x2="18" y2="17" stroke="url(#sg2)" stroke-width="1.4" stroke-linecap="round"/>
    </svg>
    <nav class="v2-lang" aria-label="Sprache">
      <a href="/v2/" class="on" aria-label="Deutsch">DE</a>
      <span class="v2-lang-slash" aria-hidden="true">/</span>
      <a href="/en/" aria-label="English">EN</a>
    </nav>
  </div>

  <div class="v2-intro">
    <h1 class="v2-name">Henrik Asmus</h1>
    <p class="v2-sub">Student des Wirtschaftsingenieurwesens. Neugierig.</p>
  </div>

  <div class="v2-row">
    <div class="v2-label-col">
      <span class="v2-label">Arbeiten</span>
    </div>
    <div>
      <span class="v2-t1">Lastannahmen</span>
      <span class="v2-t2">Ethereum als fundamentale digitale Infrastruktur</span>
      <p class="v2-meta">Masterarbeit, Eigenverlag, Juli 2026, 324 Seiten</p>
      <p class="v2-body">Die Arbeit prüft Ethereum an zwölf Kriterien für fundamentale Infrastruktur, in zwei Zuständen: im heutigen, Stand März 2026, und in dem, der sich bei vollständig umgesetzter Roadmap ergäbe. Sie ist an keiner Hochschule eingereicht. Geschrieben für Entscheider in Unternehmen, Kapitalgeber, technische Architekten und Politik, nicht für die Szene.</p>
      <div class="v2-links">
        <a href="/lastannahmen/">Zur Arbeit</a>
        <a href="/pdf/Lastannahmen.pdf" class="dim">PDF Deutsch</a>
        <a href="/pdf/Load-Assumptions.pdf" class="dim">PDF English</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="v2-row">
    <div class="v2-label-col">
      <span class="v2-label">Kontakt</span>
    </div>
    <div>
      <a class="v2-email" href="mailto:HenrikAsmus@proton.me">HenrikAsmus@proton.me</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>
</body>
</html>
